flowchart TB
Read[Read AGENTS runbooks and actual current evidence] --> Scope[Pick one small reversible issue]
Scope --> Dev[Work on existing dev preserving other changes]
Dev --> Test[Run focused tests contracts builds and security]
Test --> Docs[Update affected diagram API or schema reference]
Docs --> Review[Inspect staged diff and automated review]
Review --> Push[Push dev and PR to staging]
Push --> CI[Exact source full CI and hosted synthetic staging acceptance]
CI --> Gate[Release qualification and authorized owner decision]
Gate --> Main[PR staging to main]
Main --> Verify[Deploy and verify actual source and recovery]
Failure[Failed check] --> Dev
